menu "Callbox Security"

    config CALLBOX_PRODUCTION_BUILD
        bool "Require the production hardware-security profile"
        default n
        help
            Marks this firmware as a production image. CMake rejects the build
            unless Secure Boot V2, flash encryption in release mode, and NVS
            encryption are enabled. Enabling those ESP-IDF features can burn
            eFuses on first boot; follow docs/SECURITY.md before flashing.

    config CALLBOX_ALLOW_ANONYMOUS_MQTT
        bool "Allow MQTT without username/password (development only)"
        depends on !CALLBOX_PRODUCTION_BUILD
        default n
        help
            Allows connection to a broker without both a username and password.
            Keep this disabled except for an isolated development broker.

endmenu
